@startuml
title Діаграма станів процесу купівлі квитків

[*] --> Unauthenticated

state "Unauthenticated" as Unauthenticated
state "Authenticating" as Authenticating
state "Authenticated (Browsing)" as Browsing
state "Selecting seat" as Selecting

state "Occupied (Reserved)" as Occupied {
    state "Waiting for Payment" as Waiting
    state "Processing Payment" as Processing

    [*] --> Waiting
    Waiting --> Processing : Start payment / redirect to Bank
    Processing --> Waiting : Payment failed or cancelled
}

state "Bought" as Bought

Unauthenticated --> Authenticating : Authentication Request

Authenticating --> Browsing : Validate user info [valid]
Authenticating --> Unauthenticated : Validate user info [invalid]

Browsing --> Selecting : Select seating place
Selecting --> Browsing : Cancel selection
Selecting --> Occupied : Book place(s) / setTimeout(15), markOccupied

Processing --> Bought : Bank confirm / markBought, sendEmail

Occupied --> Browsing : Timer timeout [15 min] / cancel, markAvailable

Browsing --> [*] : Leave
Bought --> [*]

note right of Occupied
  Таймер (15 хв) діє на весь стан Occupied,
  у тому числі під час Processing.
end note

@enduml
